Maps from real geography – sources, licences and attribution (ADR 0018, extends ADR 0011)
=========================================================================================

The maps in this folder (data/maps/*.tres) are generated by tools/import_map.py from
two open data sets. The raw downloads stay in a local cache outside the repository
(~/.cache/eastern-flank/maps); only the generated hex maps are committed. The game never goes
online.

Land cover: OpenStreetMap
-------------------------
Map data (c) OpenStreetMap contributors, available under the Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0,
https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright – downloaded through the Overpass API
(https://overpass-api.de).

The hex maps are a derivative database of OpenStreetMap data (land use / natural areas reduced
to one terrain and cover class per hex, roads and waterways reduced to links between
neighbouring hexes). In line with the ODbL share-alike clause, the terrain
and cover data of every map listed below is made available under the ODbL 1.0 as well, and
anyone can rebuild it from OpenStreetMap with tools/import_map.py and the command given below.

